{# ===== OUR STORY ===== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-story fade-in">
      <div class="about-story__content">
        <div class="about-story__label">Why We Started</div>
        <h2>A Journey Born From <em>Love</em></h2>
        <p>When I brought home my first puppy, I was completely overwhelmed. Every Google search led to conflicting advice. Every pet store employee recommended something different. I just wanted one reliable place with honest, expert-backed information.</p>
        <p>That's why PetBuddyHub exists. We're real pet parents who've been through it all. The midnight vet visits, the chewed-up shoes, and the unconditional love that makes every challenge worth it.</p>
        <p>Our mission is simple: <strong>make pet care less stressful and more joyful.</strong> Every article is researched, every product review is honest, and every tip has been tested by actual pet owners.</p>
        <a href="{{ '/start-here/' | url }}" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 16px;">Start Here {{ icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="about-story__image">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/zigmarsberzins-girl-5623231_1920.jpg' | url }}" alt="Pet owner bonding with dog" loading="lazy">
        <div class="about-story__image-badge">
          <span class="about-story__image-badge-num">5+</span>
          <span class="about-story__image-badge-text">Years of Experience</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

